Author
------
Joeri Van Dooren (ON6URE) — RF.Guru

Participants
------------
The sysops and stations of ON0ORA and ON0DEN, who ran it on the air first,
keyed up on request and told us how it sounded.

Manu (ON7FQ) — the carrier after the identification on a quiet channel
(`[ident] hang_ms`).

Add your name here with your first contribution.

Built on the work of others
---------------------------
SvxLink / SvxReflector by Tobias Blomberg (SM0SVX) and contributors: TailChaser
speaks their reflector and RemoteTrx protocols. No SvxLink code is included.
Opus (Xiph.Org), OpenSSL, ALSA, libgpiod.
